  "project": {
    "name": "Helios — Customer Data Platform Migration",
    "description": "Move every customer-data workload from the on-premise Oracle warehouse and the nightly batch ETL to a cloud customer data platform (CDP) with streaming ingestion, a governed semantic layer and self-service analytics.\n\n**Why:** the warehouse licence ends on 31 March 2027, nightly loads miss the 06:00 SLA two days in five, and marketing waits a week for new segments.\n\n**Success criteria**\n- 100% of the 42 source systems ingested, reconciled to the cent against the warehouse for two consecutive month-ends\n- Segment build time under 15 minutes, data freshness under 5 minutes for the 8 streaming sources\n- GDPR erasure requests executed end to end in under 24 hours\n- Warehouse decommissioned and licence returned before the hard deadline",
    "status": "In Progress",
    "priority": "High",
    "start_date": "2026-09-01",
    "due_date": "2027-03-12",
    "deadline_at": "2027-03-31",
    "budget": 480000,
