  "runbook": {
    "folder": "Runbooks",
    "name": "Cut-over runbook.md",
    "content": "# Helios cut-over runbook\n\n## T-7 days\n- Freeze schema changes on the 12 billing sources\n- Confirm reconciliation report for the last month-end is green\n\n## T-1 day\n- Pause nightly ETL after the final load\n- Snapshot the warehouse (retention: 10 years)\n\n## Cut-over (Saturday 06:00)\n1. Switch BI connections to the semantic layer\n2. Run smoke dashboards (revenue, churn, active customers)\n3. Compare totals with the snapshot; tolerance 0 on amounts\n\n## Roll-back\nRe-point BI to the warehouse snapshot; the CDP keeps ingesting so no data is lost.\n"
